      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MELLCAT BAD BOY (3) started big odds in far stiffer grade latest when finishing 5th over 440m at Goulburn. Was a winner the start prior in easier at this track. Key runner on his best form. KING CALYMEA (7) was strongly fancied latest and proved too good with a 4 length win at this track in a handy 20.83. Draws out wide but in form and has the ability. Form from his last run is proving to be solid. Has hit winning form and can measure up again. JUST FLICK 'EM (4) was an effortless winner two back scoring by 2.75 lengths but could manage only midfield last time when finished 5th and beaten 5.5 lengths at this track (21.39). Remains without a win from the draw but has been in the placings four times from six attempts. Bold showing expected. LONG ISLAND BLUE (8) can sneak into the finish with the right run.",
